# Apify API token.
#
# Only required if you authenticate the Apify MCP server with a bearer token
# instead of OAuth (see docs/apify-mcp.md). Get it from:
#   Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations
#
# Never commit a real value. `.gitignore` already covers `.env` and
# `.env*.local`, so put the real token in `.env.local` (next dev) or your
# shell environment.
APIFY_TOKEN=
